<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<title>Linxira Bio SDK</title>
<meta name="description" content="Linxira Bio SDK 子站入口：按浏览器语言进入中文或英文的本地生信平台站点。">
	<script is:inline>
		const lang = navigator.language.startsWith('zh') ? 'zh' : 'en';
		window.location.replace('/bio-sdk/' + lang + '/');
	</script>
</head>
<body>
	<p>Redirecting... <a href="/bio-sdk/en/">English</a> | <a href="/bio-sdk/zh/">中文</a></p>
</body>
</html>